      "updated": 1768836153252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Hard to perform cluster maintenance - many apps \nwith different maintenance windows\n\n* Barrier to entry to get new teams / apps onto \nthe platform\n\n* Fragmented Infrastructure ownership \n\n* Difficult to automate cluster creation\n\n* Not suitable for sandbox environments\n\n* Not possible to allow delegated administration\n\n* Increased interest in diversifying underlying\n infrastructure platform to reduce costs and risk\n\n* Need access to specialised hardware (GPU) or \nbaremetal \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 21.31545335287968,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Hard to perform cluster maintenance - many apps \nwith different maintenance windows\n\n* Barrier to entry to get new teams / apps onto \nthe platform\n\n* Fragmented Infrastructure ownership \n\n* Difficult to automate cluster creation\n\n* Not suitable for sandbox environments\n\n* Not possible to allow delegated administration\n\n* Increased interest in diversifying underlying\n infrastructure platform to reduce costs and risk\n\n* Need access to specialised hardware (GPU) or \nbaremetal \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
